{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-87","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the third apotome.","book":10,"number":87,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.87","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.87/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":87,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","contentId":"euclid-10-87","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"407c938c49b8346f26547e9f3e3856b6cd4632dc75b144c3e04bcc7103aaba01","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-87.statement","euclid-10-87.construction.1","euclid-10-87.construction.2","euclid-10-87.proof.1","euclid-10-87.proof.2","euclid-10-87.proof.3","euclid-10-87.proof.4","euclid-10-87.proof.5","euclid-10-87.proof.6","euclid-10-87.proof.7","euclid-10-87.proof.8","euclid-10-87.proof.9","euclid-10-87.proof.10","euclid-10-87.proof.11","euclid-10-87.proof.12","euclid-10-87.proof.13","euclid-10-87.proof.14","euclid-10-87.proof.15","euclid-10-87.proof.16","euclid-10-87.conclusion","euclid-10-87.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-87.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55d94b0bfb3cff5566f6c2b31208bbb42223af7479ac261599e1e0d86d70eb3a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the third apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找第三个截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b7fd5226b0b783aa41e53fbb857461c2f168c2db20c3a8f751a2bb99c9c4f25","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, let three numbers E, BC, CD be set out which have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, but let CB have to BD the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 A,列出三个数字E,BC,CD,其中三个数字不相互对应,即平方数与平方数的比,但CB与BD的比,即平方数与平方数的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ccb660f560017574ef2871f6fbf90bb2366eb37124d1307bcca5d163b5fa8bc","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, and, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设E比BC等于A比正方形比FG比正方形,BC比CD等于正方形比正方形比GH比正方形 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff04447773ae0521b228131df7c154b5af47a7a48c69938e24fb518d14d0077a","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, therefore the square on A is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,E比BC等于A比正方形,FG比正方形,因此,A比正方形等于可公度,FG比正方形 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c422455f5409a0a60cfe17f6343295f9b37751e7d73a8e62fc6cc1e4b5c120e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on A is rational; therefore the square on FG is also rational; therefore FG is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A的正方形是有理;FG的正方形也是有理;FG是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4855eb884ac4bead1fb9c9bdf84ea90947cd615501dd9bd54a83967d52fa28aa","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E has not to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on A to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore A is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于E的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,BC的比例为平方数,FG的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,FG的比例为平方数,A的比例为不可公度,FG的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"947545009dbd37fb75b1653fb7b472182f3ea4010c1f1d6e17ad9f7298150e2b","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore the square on FG is commensurable with the square on GH. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,BC比CD等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,FG比正方形等于可公度,GH比正方形 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"749009a8e782af14234dd51e166bd9b0a94667320430ae45f03b94e29bad6d42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on FG is rational; therefore the square on GH is also rational; therefore GH is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FG的正方形是有理;GH的正方形也是有理;GH是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7b8779b158064c20aed9bde4778b400515ac6d68de838d5ce683edb57c2738f","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BC has not to CD the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on FG to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BC的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,CD的比例为平方数,GH的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,GH的比例为平方数,FG的比例为不可公度,GH的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11f94dc719987fb814226b450b06e2e86e9d692457ed6fa305cd5902af0f8040","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore FH is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,FG,GH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,FH是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68a9d7d756e73183d9604fcc8f6742a2605b9382ccb6e5f2a9f8ba6e4d38749f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a third apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第三个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8a000da935e652b627b2da04f197d11c8dd60e04e50923053640e7dba87ce36","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, and, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on HG, therefore, ex aequali, as E is to CD, so is the square on A to the square on HG. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E比BC,相当于A比正方形,FG比正方形,CD比正方形,因此,从平等角度看,E比HG比正方形,A比正方形 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b24aeb56d2f78ff178d14160229c04a761d40772e35f16ac31091d0f8785199d","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E has not to CD the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on A to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore A is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,GH的比例为正方形,而A的比例为正方形,而GH的比例为平方数;因此,A的比例为不可公度,而GH的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：CD） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"653e40275f5cced64f2e9262cd4d62bdea57400c82a7d959e20cffda269072ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore neither of the straight lines FG, GH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG、GH两条直线都没有长度可公度,有理线段、A直线已经确定。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2decf6a5ac48c7e4116f6afaeace2ec17b617076810664e220a821fb9ad2fa7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square on K be that by which the square on FG is greater than the square on GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,K正方形,就是FG正方形比GH正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18319fb817f4695cadd5b7d361e098b036aeda0b9a74477316c45876091e7fb1","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore, convertendo, as BC is to BD, so is the square on FG to the square on K. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,BC比CD等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,转换率BC比BD等于FG比正方形比正方形（相关点与线段：K） [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b666bda37ac467e8ee5b0d329d8521c7502ea1a227417f9d9128e383ead8461","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC has to BD the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore the square on FG also has to the square on K the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC比平方数比平方数比平方数,FG比正方形比正方形比K比平方数比平方数比平方数。（相关点与线段：BD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1991baad4ec667993e30ae90e16762af696e6a21806523f672bb4ef422a83ab","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is commensurable in length with K, [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] and the square on FG is greater than the square on GH by the square on a straight line commensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG是长度可公度,K,FG是正方形,比GH的正方形,比正方形,直线可公度和FG的正方形要多。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e8d306598ad22d8d9f4da2ff4251d47df69c966b7b47cf287ebe30eb8009480","citations":["euclid-10-def-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of the straight lines FG, GH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A set out; therefore FH is a third apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG线,GH线, 都没有长度可公度,有理线段A线已经确定, 所以FH线是第三个截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c49b8346f","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cfd1371a3a5e6adaf622a17ae9fc61573fc09945ff619e3168bc8b785754030","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the third apotome FH has been found. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,已发现第三个截差无理线段 FH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-87.source","contentId":"euclid-10-87","revisionId":"euclid-10-87@raw-407c938c4